        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Contractual Agreement—A unit member granted leave for improvement shall enter into a written contract by which he/she agrees to return to service in the Montgomery County Public Schools for at least a one-year period immediately following the termination of the leave. If the unit member fails to return and remain in service for at least one (1) year, he/she shall refund any monies paid to him/her or on his/her behalf by the Board of Education.",
            "block_bbox": [
